Key Takeaway

Azure Monitor provides comprehensive monitoring capabilities for Azure Virtual Machines by collecting both platform-level host metrics and guest operating system data. Using Azure Monitor, Metrics Explorer, VM Insights, Azure Monitor Agent, and Log Analytics Workspaces, Azure Administrators can proactively detect performance issues, analyze system health, troubleshoot problems, and maintain highly available and reliable Azure environments. Understanding the difference between host metrics and guest metrics, along with VM Insights and Log Analytics, is essential for the AZ-104 exam.
